Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 800
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 8ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.15

Hide
Type "setopt interactivecomments"
Enter
Show

Type "# /x-reach — Job 1 (paste a draft, no CLI)"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "# Draft A — bait close (produced an edit)"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "cat <<'DRAFT'"
Enter
Type "everyone says to post 3x a day. i tried it for 30 days and my"
Enter
Type "reach went DOWN 40%. here's the exact spacing that worked instead,"
Enter
Type "and the one setting nobody checks. drop a 🔥 if you want the"
Enter
Type "full breakdown"
Enter
Type "DRAFT"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "cat <<'EOF'"
Enter
Type "CLOSED — Still findable next month (video long tail): no video"
Enter
Type "  (phoenix-rankall/src/config/mod.rs:139-156)"
Enter
Type "PENDING — A bump while you're small (cold start): eligible, pending"
Enter
Type "  top-85% pool position per request (author_cold_start.rs:167-178)"
Enter
Type "PENDING — Strangers' For You (Phoenix retrieval): eligible, pending"
Enter
Type "  first like → 1fav (:78-92); 32 likes → 32fav (:62-76)"
Enter
Type "PENDING — People already into this (SimClusters): eligible, pending"
Enter
Type "  8 likes for persistent embedding (Configs.scala:65)"
Enter
Type "OPEN — Your followers (Thunder): in-network by default"
Enter
Type "  (thunder/config.rs:5-6; config.rs:36)"
Enter
Type "CLEAR — The kill switch: no supplied label or URL verdict; VF is idle"
Enter
Type "  (registry.rs:101-170). See Judgment: J-ENGAGEMENT-BAIT"
Enter
Type "  (text only; does not trip this door)."
Enter
Type ""
Enter
Type "Judgment: J-ENGAGEMENT-BAIT."
Enter
Type ""
Enter
Type "The one edit: Drop the bait close. Protects The kill switch"
Enter
Type "  (visibility filtering)."
Enter
Type ""
Enter
Type "### Rewrite"
Enter
Type "everyone says to post 3x a day. i tried it for 30 days and my"
Enter
Type "reach went DOWN 40%. here's the exact spacing that worked instead,"
Enter
Type "and the one setting nobody checks. ~~drop a 🔥 if you want the"
Enter
Type "full breakdown~~"
Enter
Type ""
Enter
Type "This reads the code they published, not the live knobs they can"
Enter
Type "turn on you tomorrow."
Enter
Type "EOF"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "# /x-reach — Job 1, same doors, clean original"
Enter
Sleep 400ms

Type "# Draft B — no manufactured edit"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "cat <<'DRAFT'"
Enter
Type "just shipped a tiny CLI that turns any github repo into a"
Enter
Type "single markdown file for pasting into an LLM. 200 lines of"
Enter
Type "python, no deps."
Enter
Type "DRAFT"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "cat <<'EOF'"
Enter
